<title>JAPAN: Foreigners net buyers of Japan stocks via 10 firms.</title>
<headline>Foreigners net buyers of Japan stocks via 10 firms.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-03-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Orders placed by foreign investors through 10 foreign securities houses before the start of stock trading on Wednesday showed a net buying stance of 9.4 million shares, market sources said.</p>
<p>Foreign investor buy orders totalled 25.00 million shares while sell orders amounted to 15.60 million shares.</p>
